msgid "RTL8139 网络驱动"
msgstr "RTL8139 network driver"

msgid ""
"``drivers/net/rtl8139/`` 为 Ethernet PCI ``10ec:8139`` 提供原生 RTL8139 驱动。``CONFIG_RTL8139`` 为 "
"tristate，默认内置；设置为 ``m`` 时生成 ``drivers/net/rtl8139/rtl8139.ko``，携带对应的 PCI 模块别名。每个匹配 的 PCI "
"功能独立注册网络接口，复用现有 IPv4/IPv6、socket 和网络配置接口。"
msgstr ""
"``drivers/net/rtl8139/`` provides a native RTL8139 driver for Ethernet PCI ``10ec:8139``. "
"``CONFIG_RTL8139`` is a tristate, built in by default; selecting ``m`` produces "
"``drivers/net/rtl8139/rtl8139.ko`` with the corresponding PCI module alias. Each matching PCI"
" function registers an independent network interface using the existing IPv4/IPv6, socket and"
" network configuration interfaces."

msgid "设备范围与收发"
msgstr "Device scope and packet I/O"

msgid ""
"驱动使用经典 RTL8139 的 I/O BAR0、32 位 DMA 地址和内置 PHY 状态， 包括 QEMU 的 RTL8139C+ 模型在经典模式下的使用。它与 ``r8169``"
" 的 RTL8168/RTL8125 驱动独立，不启用 C+ 描述符模式或硬件校验和卸载。 仅提供 MMIO、没有有效 256 字节 I/O 窗口的设备返回不支持。"
msgstr ""
"The driver uses classic RTL8139 I/O BAR0, 32-bit DMA addresses and the integrated PHY status,"
" including the QEMU RTL8139C+ model in classic mode. It is independent of the RTL8168/RTL8125"
" ``r8169`` driver and does not enable C+ descriptor mode or hardware checksum offloads. "
"Devices providing only MMIO without a valid 256-byte I/O window are unsupported."

msgid ""
"接口 MTU 为 1500。发送支持四个独立的 2048 字节缓冲区；短帧补零至 60 字节，由硬件添加 FCS。队列满返回 ``EAGAIN``，不等待硬件完成。 "
"仅在设备交回所有权并报告终态后才复用发送缓冲区。"
msgstr ""
"The interface MTU is 1500. Transmission uses four independent 2048-byte buffers. Short frames"
" are padded with zero bytes to 60 bytes and the hardware appends FCS. A full queue returns "
"``EAGAIN`` without waiting for completion. A transmit buffer is reused only after the device "
"returns ownership and reports a terminal status."

msgid ""
"接收使用带额外 DMA 安全空间的 32 KiB 环，处理跨环边界的报文、 四字节记录对齐和 CAPR 的 16 字节偏移。驱动校验状态与长度，剥离 FCS； CRC "
"等错误和输出容量不足的记录被消费并报告错误，不阻塞后续报文。 接收过滤允许本站单播、广播和多播，以支持 IPv6 邻居发现。"
msgstr ""
"Reception uses a 32 KiB ring with additional DMA safety space, handling packets crossing the "
"ring boundary, four-byte record alignment and the 16-byte CAPR offset. The driver validates "
"status and length and strips FCS. Records with CRC or other errors, or insufficient output "
"capacity, are consumed and reported as errors without blocking later packets. Filtering "
"accepts station unicast, broadcast and multicast for IPv6 neighbor discovery."

msgid ""
"RTL8139 使用传统 INTx。驱动保持设备中断屏蔽和 PCI INTx 禁用，使用 现有任务上下文轮询，不猜测共享 IRQ 路由。其吞吐量和 CPU 开销需要 单独实测，不能从标称"
" 100 Mbit/s 推断实际性能。"
msgstr ""
"RTL8139 uses traditional INTx. The driver keeps device interrupts masked and PCI INTx "
"disabled, using existing task-context polling without guessing shared IRQ routing. Throughput"
" and CPU overhead require separate measurement; the nominal 100 Mbit/s rate does not "
"establish actual performance."

msgid "资源与恢复"
msgstr "Resources and recovery"

msgid ""
"PCI 能力链经过长度、对齐和循环检查后才能请求 D0。RX/TX 缓冲区由 DMA32 分配器分配，并验证完整地址范围和 CPU 映射；物理地址不会作为 CPU "
"指针使用。全部缓冲区就绪后才启用 PCI bus master 和收发引擎。"
msgstr ""
"The PCI capability list is checked for bounds, alignment and cycles before requesting D0. "
"RX/TX buffers come from the DMA32 allocator, with complete address-range and CPU-mapping "
"checks; physical addresses are never used as CPU pointers. PCI bus mastering and packet "
"engines are enabled only after all buffers are ready."

msgid ""
"接收溢出、损坏的记录长度或五秒未完成的发送触发有界控制器复位， 在确认停止后重建已有队列；在途报文可能丢失，由上层协议处理。 恢复不分配内存或睡眠。复位失败或 PCI "
"总线错误使设备停止接收新请求， 保留 DMA，等待卸载或重新加载时的安全处理。"
msgstr ""
"Receive overflow, corrupt record lengths or a transmit operation incomplete for five seconds "
"trigger a bounded controller reset. Existing queues are rebuilt after confirmed quiescence; "
"in-flight packets may be lost and are handled by upper-layer protocols. Recovery neither "
"allocates memory nor sleeps. Reset failure or a PCI bus error closes request admission and "
"retains DMA for safe handling during unload or reload."

msgid ""
"卸载先关闭并排空网络回调，再禁用 bus master、屏蔽设备中断并确认复位。 无法证明停止时向管理器报告错误，保留设备、DMA 和模块代码供后续重试。 "
"释放缓冲区后不恢复固件原先启用的 bus master 位。"
msgstr ""
"Unloading closes and drains network callbacks before disabling bus mastering, masking device "
"interrupts and confirming reset. If STOP cannot be proven, the manager is notified and the "
"device, DMA and module code remain retained for retry. Firmware bus mastering is not restored"
" after buffers have been released."

msgid "使用与验证"
msgstr "Usage and validation"

msgid "在 ReliefOS 父仓中，可以选择该 QEMU 设备："
msgstr "Select this QEMU device in the ReliefOS parent repository:"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_rtl8139.py`` 在 ASan/UBSan 下编译真实驱动对象，只替换 PCI、端口 I/O、DMA 和核心服务边界。它覆盖设备匹配、D0、DMA32、"
" 收发回绕、补零、背压、错误记录、溢出与超时恢复、多设备隔离以及 初始化回滚和失败 STOP 的资源保留。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_rtl8139.py`` compiles the production driver objects under ASan/UBSan, replacing "
"only the PCI, port I/O, DMA and core-service boundaries. It covers device matching, D0, "
"DMA32, TX/RX wraparound, padding, backpressure, invalid records, overflow and timeout "
"recovery, device isolation, initialization rollback and resource retention on failed STOP."

msgid ""
"内核的 ``tools/tests/multinic_guest.c`` 提供标准 socket 探针；其 ``stress`` 模式逐地址族校验 1 MiB TCP 回显数据和 32 "
"个不同长度的 UDP 数据报。ReliefOS 的 ``tools/test_rtl8139_qemu.py`` 编排两张 RTL8139 与 一张 e1000e，检查独立 "
"DHCP、IPv4/IPv6、并发数据、carrier 断开恢复， 以及模块卸载期间其他驱动的活动连接和重新加载。"
msgstr ""
"The kernel provides the standard socket probe ``tools/tests/multinic_guest.c``. Its "
"``stress`` mode verifies one MiB of TCP echo data and 32 UDP datagrams of different lengths "
"per address family. ReliefOS ``tools/test_rtl8139_qemu.py`` orchestrates two RTL8139 devices "
"and one e1000e, checking independent DHCP, IPv4/IPv6, concurrent traffic, carrier "
"loss/recovery, an active connection through another driver during module removal, and reload."

msgid "宿主边界测试、QEMU BIOS/UEFI、模块重载和实体硬件验证分别记录结果。 QEMU 的成功不表示实体 RTL8139 或 VMware 已经验证。"
msgstr ""
"Record host boundary tests, QEMU BIOS/UEFI, module reload and physical hardware validation "
"separately. QEMU success does not establish validation on a physical RTL8139 or VMware."

msgid ""
"寄存器语义参照 `QEMU RTL8139 设备模型 <https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/v7.2.0/hw/net/rtl8139.c>`_ 核对。 "
"实现为 ReliefNT 原创 Apache-2.0 代码，不包含该 GPL 源文件的实现代码。"
msgstr ""
"Register semantics were checked against the `QEMU RTL8139 device model "
"<https://github.com/qemu/qemu/blob/v7.2.0/hw/net/rtl8139.c>`_. This is original ReliefNT "
"Apache-2.0 code and contains no implementation code from that GPL source file."
